  "Weaving, tailoring, metalwork and inlay — the ateliers behind Made in Egypt.": "Weberei, Schneiderei, Metallarbeiten und Intarsien – die Ateliers hinter Made in Egypt.",
  "Wellness & Retreats": "Wellness & Retreats",
