  "A land that built a civilisation, defended it, and still does": "这片土地曾经建立文明、捍卫文明，并将继续如此",
  "A medieval administrative heartland between the Damietta and Rosetta branches, long known for its agricultural wealth.": "Un cœur administratif médiéval entre les bras de Damiette et de Rosette, longtemps connu pour sa richesse agricole.",
  "A medieval Mediterranean port besieged in three crusades, and Egypt's furniture capital since the Ottoman era.": "Un port méditerranéen médiéval assiégé lors de trois croisades, et la capitale égyptienne du meuble depuis l'ère ottomane.",
  "A national challenge across every Egyptian governorate.": "埃及每个省份面临的全国性挑战。",
  "A new generation of Egyptian designers reworking pharaonic, Coptic and Islamic motifs into contemporary ready-to-wear — made locally, sold globally.": "新一代埃及设计师将法老、科普特和伊斯兰图案融入当代成衣设计——本土制造，全球销售。",
  "A partner cannot be marked ACTIVE until every gate is cleared. Claims such as \"Official\" or \"Verified by Egyptora Hub\" are only displayed where retained evidence supports that exact claim.": "在所有关卡通过前，合作伙伴无法被标记为“ACTIVE（活跃）”。只有当保留的证据支持时，才会显示诸如“官方”或“经Egyptora Hub验证”等声明。",
  "A partner cannot be set ACTIVE until identity/company verification, required licence information, terms acceptance, data-processing requirements, service-specific compliance documents and admin approval are all complete.": "Un partenaire ne peut être défini comme ACTIF que lorsque la vérification de l'identité/de l'entreprise, les informations de licence requises, l'acceptation des conditions, les exigences de traitement des données, les documents de conformité spécifiques au service et l'approbation de l'administrateur sont tous complétés.",
  "A short history": "简史",
