  "Contract performance (bookings and account services), legitimate interests (platform safety and fraud prevention), legal obligations, and consent for optional processing such as marketing, precise location and promotional media use.": "Exécution du contrat (réservations et services de compte), intérêts légitimes (sécurité de la plateforme et prévention de la fraude), obligations légales, et consentement pour le traitement optionnel tel que le marketing, la localisation précise et l'utilisation de médias promotionnels.",
  "Controls": "Contrôles",
  "Conversation content is processed to answer requests. Where AI processing of personal data requires consent, that consent is recorded separately and can be withdrawn.": "Le contenu de la conversation est traité pour répondre aux demandes. Lorsque le traitement des données personnelles par IA nécessite un consentement, ce consentement est enregistré séparément et peut être retiré.",
  "Cookie Policy": "Politique en matière de cookies",
  "Copper hammered in the same alleys since the Mamluks, looms still threaded by hand, spice sacks opened at dawn, fields worked at the pace of the flood. Egypt's crafts are not heritage displays — they are working businesses you can visit, commission from and buy. This chapter opens the workshops, the souks, the farms and the ordinary street so travellers can plan a day inside the real economy of the country.": "自马穆鲁克王朝以来，铜器在相同的巷子里被锤打；织布机仍由手工穿线；香料袋在黎明时分打开；田地以洪水般的速度耕作。埃及的手工艺品不是遗产展示——它们是正在运营的业务，您可以参观、委托制作和购买。本章向旅行者开放了作坊、市集、农场和普通街道，以便他们能规划一天时间深入了解该国真实的经济。",
  "Copper, clay, glass, palm fibre and applique — living crafts practised in the same quarters for centuries. Meet the makers, watch the work, buy directly at fair prices.": "铜器、陶器、玻璃器、棕榈纤维和贴花——数世纪以来在同一街区传承的活态手工艺。与匠人见面，观看制作过程，以公道的价格直接购买。",
  "Copper, glass and lanterns with a craft guide.": "铜器、玻璃和灯笼，配有手工艺指南。",
