  "Every document below must be confirmed by qualified Egyptian legal counsel before production launch.": "以下每份文件在正式发布前必须经合格的埃及法律顾问确认。",
  "Every era in this encyclopedia is a script waiting for a camera. Egyptora Hub's film desk exists to turn documented history into world-class Egyptian films, series and animation — shot in Egypt, produced by Egyptian talent, distributed globally. For investors it is a pipeline: studios, locations, post-production, training and film tourism. For visitors it is a reason to stand where the scene was shot.": "这部百科全书中的每个时代都是等待摄像机拍摄的剧本。Egyptora Hub 的电影部门致力于将记录在案的历史转化为世界级的埃及电影、剧集和动画片——在埃及拍摄，由埃及人才制作，全球发行。对于投资者来说，这是一条完整的产业链：工作室、拍摄地点、后期制作、培训和电影旅游。对于游客来说，这是一个站在拍摄场景地的理由。",
  "Every flag Egypt has raised tells you who was standing on the riverbank that century. The crescent of the Khedivate, the tricolour of 1952, the two stars of the United Arab Republic, the Eagle of Saladin still on the mast today — read in sequence, they are a national autobiography in cloth. Beside them stand the coats of arms, the official flags of the state's institutions, and the anthems Egyptians have sung from *Salam Li Misr* to *Bilady, Bilady, Bilady*.": "埃及升起的每一面旗帜都告诉您那个世纪谁曾站在河岸边。赫迪夫的月牙旗、1952年的三色旗、阿拉伯联合共和国的两颗星、如今仍在旗杆上的萨拉丁之鹰——按顺序阅读，它们是一部布料上的国家自传。旁边是国徽、国家机构的官方旗帜，以及埃及人从《埃及万岁》（*Salam Li Misr*）到《我的祖国，我的祖国，我的祖国》（*Bilady, Bilady, Bilady*）所唱的国歌。",
  "Every governmental integration carries one of four statuses: DEMO, SANDBOX, PENDING APPROVAL or LIVE. The current status is displayed wherever the integration surfaces data.": "Chaque intégration gouvernementale possède l'un des quatre statuts suivants : DÉMO, SANDBOX, EN ATTENTE D'APPROBATION ou EN DIRECT. Le statut actuel est affiché partout où l'intégration présente des données.",
  "Every listed mill carries a traceable certification code.": "每个列出的工厂都带有可追溯的认证代码。",
  "Every message contains a working opt-out, and preferences can be changed at any time in the Consent Centre. Service and booking messages are not marketing and continue regardless.": "Chaque message contient une option de désabonnement fonctionnelle, et les préférences peuvent être modifiées à tout moment dans le Centre de Consentement. Les messages de service et de réservation ne sont pas des messages marketing et continuent indépendamment.",
  "Every new feature must state the data it needs, its legal basis, its retention period and its deletion path before it is built.": "Chaque nouvelle fonctionnalité doit spécifier les données dont elle a besoin, sa base légale, sa période de rétention et son chemin de suppression avant d'être construite.",
  "Every policy governing the platform, each with its own version, owner, effective date and change history.": "管理平台的每项政策，每项都包含其自己的版本、所有者、生效日期和变更历史。",
  "Evidence": "Preuve",
  "Evolution of the Egyptian flag through the ages": "埃及国旗的时代演变",
