  "From Megiddo and Actium to Ain Jalut, Tel El Kebir and the October War.": "从米吉多和亚克兴到艾因贾鲁、泰勒凯比尔和十月战争。",
  "From Miescher in 1869 to the first complete Old Kingdom genome and the national genome centre.": "从1869年的米歇尔到第一个完整的古王国基因组以及国家基因组中心。",
  "From pre-dynastic to Fatimid": "从前王朝时期到法蒂玛王朝",
  "From the embroidered Siwan gowns of the Western Desert to the indigo galabeyas of the Delta, Egyptian dress is a living map. Each governorate keeps its own stitch, colour code and headwrap — patterns that travelled with caravans, harvests and weddings for centuries. This chapter lays the whole republic side by side so a visitor can see, in one glance, how Cairo, Sinai, Nubia and the coast dress differently while sharing one thread.": "从西部沙漠刺绣的锡瓦长袍到三角洲靛蓝的加拉贝亚，埃及服饰是一幅活生生的地图。每个省份都保留着自己的针法、颜色代码和头巾——这些图案随着商队、收获和婚礼流传了几个世纪。本章将整个共和国并置，以便游客一目了然地看到开罗、西奈、努比亚和沿海地区如何在共享一个主线的同时穿着风格各异。",
