  "The Nile slows here between black rocks and yellow dunes; feluccas drift, Nubian houses glow blue, and Abu Simbel waits upstream.": "尼罗河在这里在黑色岩石和黄色沙丘之间放缓；帆船漂流，努比亚房屋泛着蓝色光芒，阿布辛贝勒在河流上游等待。",
  "The official gateway to Egypt": "埃及官方门户",
  "The overall status of information published on Egyptora Hub.": "Egyptora Hub 上发布信息的总体状况。",
  "The Ptolemaic temple of Hathor was raised over far older sanctuaries, and its zodiac reshaped European astronomy.": "哈索尔的托勒密神庙是在更古老的圣殿之上建造的，其十二生肖重塑了欧洲天文学。",
  "The Rosetta Stone was found here in 1799; the province has guarded Egypt's western Delta approaches since antiquity.": "罗塞塔石碑于1799年在这里被发现；该省自古以来就守卫着埃及尼罗河三角洲的西部入口。",
  "The security controls Egyptora Hub maintains across identity, data, applications and operations.": "Egyptora Hub 在身份、数据、应用和运营方面保持的安全控制。",
  "The Sphinx, the Pyramids of Giza and a Nile felucca at dusk": "黄昏时分的狮身人面像、吉萨金字塔和尼罗河上的帆船",
