  "The Timeless Capital": "永恒之都",
  "The vision": "愿景",
  "The Ways of Horus, Egypt's ancient fortified highway to Asia, ran through here — Tell El Habua guards its ruins.": "连接埃及与亚洲的古老设防高速公路——荷鲁斯之路——曾穿过这里，泰尔哈布瓦守卫着它的遗迹。",
