  "Watch the Nile meet the Mediterranean at Ras El Bar, then walk workshops where walnut becomes heirloom furniture exported worldwide.": "在拉斯艾尔巴（Ras El Bar）观看尼罗河汇入地中海，然后漫步于将核桃木制成出口全球的传家宝家具的作坊。",
  "Waterwheels turn all day, waterfalls fall into desert, and whale skeletons rest in a valley that was once an ocean.": "水车日夜不停地转动，瀑布泻入沙漠，鲸鱼骨架安息在曾经是海洋的山谷中。",
  "We apply data minimisation: information is collected because a stated purpose requires it, never because it may become useful later.": "我们实行数据最小化原则：信息的收集是由于明确的目的所需，而非因为其未来可能有用。",
