  "We may suspend an account where we reasonably suspect fraud, abuse, or a breach of the Acceptable Use Policy.": "当我们有合理理由怀疑存在欺诈、滥用或违反《可接受使用政策》的行为时，我们可能会暂停账户。",
  "We may warn, restrict features, suspend or terminate accounts, and where required report activity to competent authorities.": "我们可能会发出警告、限制功能、暂停或终止账户，并在需要时向主管机构报告活动。",
  "We target WCAG 2.2 AA: keyboard operability, visible focus, sufficient contrast on the dark theme, alternative text, and full right-to-left support for Arabic.": "我们的目标是 WCAG 2.2 AA 标准：键盘操作性、可见焦点、深色主题下的足够对比度、替代文本以及对阿拉伯语的全面从右到左支持。",
