  "When location data is collected, at what precision, and how it can be turned off.": "何时、以何种精度收集位置数据，以及如何关闭位置数据。",
  "Where a case remains unresolved, external routes may be available. The applicable forum and any arbitration clause are reserved pending counsel review.": "如果案件仍未解决，可能存在外部途径。适用的法院和任何仲裁条款将保留待律师审查。",
  "Where a minor travels on a booking, only the minimum details needed for the service are collected, and they are supplied by the responsible adult.": "当未成年人通过预订旅行时，仅收集服务所需的最低限度详细信息，并由负责的成年人提供。",
  "Where a personal-data breach is likely to affect individuals, notification to those individuals and any competent authority follows the timelines applicable under Egyptian law, to be confirmed by counsel.": "当个人数据泄露可能影响个人时，向受影响个人和任何主管机构发出的通知将遵循埃及法律规定的时间表，并由律师确认。",
  "Where a service cannot be delivered for reasons outside reasonable control, Egyptora Hub will seek a supplier refund or an alternative date; specific entitlements are reserved pending counsel review.": "如果服务因超出合理控制范围的原因无法交付，Egyptora Hub 将寻求供应商退款或更改日期；具体权益将保留待律师审查。",
