  "You may request access, correction, deletion, restriction, portability, and withdraw any optional consent at any time from the Consent Centre without affecting processing performed before withdrawal.": "您可以随时在同意中心请求访问、更正、删除、限制、数据可携性，并撤回任何可选同意，但这不影响撤回前已执行的处理。",
